{"chapters":[{"title":"BFS from every empty room","code":"def walls_and_gates(rooms):\n    INF = 2147483647\n    m, n = len(rooms), len(rooms[0])\n    original = [row[:] for row in rooms]\n    for r in range(m):\n        for c in range(n):\n            if original[r][c] != INF:\n                continue\n            seen, q = {(r, c)}, deque([(r, c, 0)])\n            while q:\n                x, y, d = q.popleft()\n                if original[x][y] == 0:\n                    rooms[r][c] = d\n                    break\n                for a, b in ((x + 1, y), (x - 1, y), (x, y + 1), (x, y - 1)):\n                    if 0 <= a < m and 0 <= b < n and original[a][b] != -1 and (a, b) not in seen:\n                        seen.add((a, b)); q.append((a, b, d + 1))","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>BFS from every empty room</strong> &mdash; O((m &middot; n)&sup2;) time, O(m &middot; n) extra space. Input: <code>walls_and_gates(rooms=[[2147483647, -1], [-1, 0]])</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"grid","id":"rooms","label":"rooms","v":[["214748…","-1"],["-1","0"]],"cls":[["",""],["",""]]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>INF = 2147483647</code> &mdash; <code>INF = 2147483647</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"grid","id":"rooms","label":"rooms","v":[["214748…","-1"],["-1","0"]],"cls":[["",""],["",""]]}],"vars":[["INF","2147483647",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>m, n = len(rooms), len(rooms[0])</code> &mdash; <code>m = 2</code>; <code>n = 2</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"grid","id":"rooms","label":"rooms","v":[["214748…","-1"],["-1","0"]],"cls":[["",""],["",""]]}],"vars":[["INF","2147483647",0],["m","2",1],["n","2",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>original = [row[:] for row in rooms]</code> &mdash; <code>row = [2147483647, -1]</code>","line":4,"panels":[{"t":"grid","id":"rooms","label":"rooms","v":[["214748…","-1"],["-1","0"]],"cls":[["",""],["",""]]},{"t":"arr","id":"row","label":"row","v":["214748…","-1"],"cls":["","